  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAIR4ALL Extractive Value Chains Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to ensure that communities (with a key focus on grassroot women) from Taita Taveta, Turkana and Kwale counties where gemstones, gold and mineral sands respectively are mined, fully benefit from the sector&apos;s value chain and have the space to meaningfully engage private sector and government in securing benefits from these resources.</narrative>
  </description>
